{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51260","headline":"日出东南隅行 · 李白","name":"日出东南隅行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（《文苑英华》一九三载李白此诗，注云：「集无此诗。\n」郭茂倩《乐府诗集》以爲殷谋诗。\n）秦楼出佳丽，正值朝日光。\n陌头能驻马，花处复添香。\n（《乐府诗集》卷二八署陈殷谋，《先秦汉魏晋南北朝诗·陈诗》卷九据以收入。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51260.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51260","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}